    "UniqueID": "hw_cloak_lynx",
    "//LightCloak": "Plan N5 (light lynx cloak, pack Prompt 2): sits between vanilla's Reed Coat (warmth 6, torso armour 4, weight 1200) and the Lynx Coat (warmth 7.5, torso armour 10, aids 8.4, weight 1200). It trades warmth, armour and weight for a lighter pack; its aids are half the Lynx Coat's. No spirit essence, no Fox Urge. Every number is a TUNABLE PLACEHOLDER, session-inferred and unmeasured against play.",
