        "ParentObjectID": "hw_cloak_lynx",
        "LocalizationKey": "HarshWilds_CloakLynx_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A light cloak cut from a lynx's leather. It warms less and shields less than the Lynx Coat, but weighs half as much. While your mind is open to the spirits it lends you a little of the lynx's climbing and ambush.\n\n<b>MUST BE EQUIPPED TO WORK</b>"
